Hi all,
I 'm thankful to Mark Deiss,Remigijus Vaitelis,Phil Baldwin,Uwe
Lienig,sematin (Noah).
This was a pure DNS Problem. Entries in the DNS for Forward Lookup &
Reverse Lookup were not properly defined. It was taking 30 sec. for the
DNS getting timeout.=20
Once it was defined on the Primary DNS server the response time came
back to fraction of seconds.=20

Thanks again for explaining the theory behind it.

Regards.
Vimal=20

