Thanks to responses from Kris Chandrasekhar, Martin Adolfsson and few
others, the solution was straightforward as follows:
1.	In "/etc/ssh2/sshd2_config", unremark the "PermitRootLogin" line and
change its value to "no.
2.	Reset the sshd daemon by executing "/sbin/init.d/sshd reset".

